NAME
       pwck - check the user account files for errors

SYNOPSIS
       pwck [-r] [-s]

DESCRIPTION
       pwck checks /etc/passwd and /etc/shadow: every line has the right
       number of fields, names are unique and valid, home directories and
       shells exist, and every user in one file is in the other. It offers
       to fix the problems it finds. grpck does the same for the group files.

OPTIONS
       -r     Read-only: report problems but change nothing.

       -s     Sort the entries by UID.

EXAMPLES
           pwck -r

SEE ALSO
       grpck(8), pwconv(8), passwd(5), shadow(5)
